<header class="topbar"><a class="brand" href="/">Annotated</a><nav><?php if($viewer):?><a href="/home.php">Home</a><?php endif?><a href="/explore.php">Explore</a><?php if($viewer):?><a href="/research.php">Research</a><a href="/saved.php">Saved</a><a href="/notifications.php">Notifications</a><?php else:?><a href="/login.php">Log in</a><?php endif?></nav></header>
<main class="searchWorkspace"><section class="searchMain"><div class="pageTitle"><span class="eyebrow">PHASE 10 · DISCOVERY</span><h1>Search Annotated</h1><p>Search sources, annotations, commentary, transcripts, people, public entities, accessible Research, Findings and Claims. Permissions are checked against the relational source of truth before results are returned.</p></div>
